              <TextBlock class="copy-21 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
                <p>PORTFOLIO</p>
              </TextBlock>
              <Heading class="heading-46 block flex-block" level={3}>
                Doug Steinman building a launch-ready author website for Samuel Edmond Stone
